  "text": "proprium.dominica-iii-adventus-secreta",
  "about": "The secret of the Third Sunday of Advent. The offering is to do two things: complete the rite, and work in those who make it.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "Lord, we pray, may the sacrifice of our devotion be offered to You unceasingly; may it fulfill the rites appointed for the sacred mystery, and may it wondrously bring about Your salvation in us. Through the Lord." }
